    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to slide, slip, and stretch your brain in <i>Me Resbala!</i> \u2014 a fast-paced puzzle game where every move counts more than you think.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve quick yet clever challenges across levels full of slippery surfaces, exploding crates, and tricky obstacles. The mechanic? Slide in a direction until you hit something... and think carefully before you do!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two modes, two mindsets</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Mode:</strong> Take your time and solve each puzzle with as many moves as needed. Use logic to find the smartest solution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ninja Mode:</strong> Just one move allowed. Yep \u2014 you only get one shot to nail the perfect sequence. Fast, precise, and unforgiving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Score-based progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level is scored. Did you do well? Could you do better? Replay and refine your strategy to reach the <strong>highest score</strong> on each stage. The goal isn\u2019t just to finish \u2014 it\u2019s to finish in style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>100 short but addictive levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two ways to play: Classic and Ninja Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scoring system that rewards smart solutions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique retro visual style with hand-drawn animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for quick sessions... or obsessively chasing a perfect run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developed solo and streamed live on Twitch and YouTube (Casanova Dev)</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to slide, slip, and stretch your brain in <i>Me Resbala!</i> \u2014 a fast-paced puzzle game where every move counts more than you think.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve quick yet clever challenges across levels full of slippery surfaces, exploding crates, and tricky obstacles. The mechanic? Slide in a direction until you hit something... and think carefully before you do!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two modes, two mindsets</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Mode:</strong> Take your time and solve each puzzle with as many moves as needed. Use logic to find the smartest solution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ninja Mode:</strong> Just one move allowed. Yep \u2014 you only get one shot to nail the perfect sequence. Fast, precise, and unforgiving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Score-based progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level is scored. Did you do well? Could you do better? Replay and refine your strategy to reach the <strong>highest score</strong> on each stage. The goal isn\u2019t just to finish \u2014 it\u2019s to finish in style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>100 short but addictive levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two ways to play: Classic and Ninja Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scoring system that rewards smart solutions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique retro visual style with hand-drawn animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for quick sessions... or obsessively chasing a perfect run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developed solo and streamed live on Twitch and YouTube (Casanova Dev)</strong></p></li></ul>",
